<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Outback, Lone Star raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Outback, Lone Star raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Outback Steakhouse Inc and Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc to buy from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Lone Star ended Friday at 26-15/16 and Outback ended at 26-3/4.</p>
</text>
